CALLER: Hi, yeah, my name's Terrence Pemberton, loan number 7037643310. My hours at work got cut in half and I heard about loan modifications. I want to get this started.
ASSISTANT: Hi Terrence, thanks for calling. I'm sorry to hear about the cut in your hours—that's tough.

Before we talk about options, I need to verify you're on this loan. Can you give me:

1. Your full name, exactly as you'd say it
2. The last 4 digits of your Social Security number
3. The ZIP code of the property

Just as you have them—don't worry about what might be on file.
CALLER: Sure - Terrence Pemberton, SSN last four is 7628, and the ZIP is 86750.
    [tool verify_identity({"loan_number": "7037643310", "full_name": "Terrence Pemberton", "last4_ssn": "7628", "zip_code": "86750"}) -> ok: {
  "verified": true
}]
    [tool create_task({"loan_number": "7037643310", "task_type": "hardship_review", "note": "Borrower Terrence Pemberton reports work hours cut in half. Requesting loan modification. Verified and ready for specialist review."}) -> ok: {
  "task_id": 1
}]
    [tool add_loan_comment({"loan_number": "7037643310", "text": "Terrence Pemberton called requesting loan modification due to reduced work hours (hardship). Verified. Created hardship_review task and transferring to specialist."}) -> ok: {
  "saved": true
}]
    [tool transfer_to_human({"loan_number": "7037643310", "reason": "hardship", "note": "Borrower reports work hours cut in half; requesting loan modification. Verified. Hardship task created."}) -> ok: {
  "transferred": true,
  "message": "A human agent will take over this call."
}]
ASSISTANT: Great, you're verified. Thanks for that.

I hear you about the reduced hours—that's a hardship situation, and we can help you explore options. Because of what you're going through, I'm going to connect you with a specialist who handles loan modifications and hardship reviews. They'll have the tools and authority to look at what might be available for your specific situation.

Let me get that set up for you and get you to someone who can really help. One moment.

Perfect. I've opened a hardship review for you and I'm transferring you now to a specialist who can walk through your options. They'll be able to review what modifications or forbearance programs might work for your situation.

Hang tight—connecting you now.
